    "title": "Merrick County Sheriff's Office responds to vehicle rollover accident on Highway 92 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brian Neben ,\n14 hours ago MERRICK CO. — On Monday, Oct. 5 at approximately 8:05 a.m. hours, the Merrick County Sheriff’s Office was detailed to a one vehicle injury crash on Highway 92 and 21st Rd. A preliminary investigation revealed that a 2023 Volkswagen Tiguan was eastbound on Highway 92 when the vehicle was witnessed drifting to the right and then to the left, crossing the center line and driving into the north ditch. Read full article\n3",
